\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Physical verification latency as a function of CFG complexity. The interval-based abstract interpretation maintains strict linear scaling $\mathcal  {O}(|V| + |E|)$. Empirical measurements confirm that even for dense, multi-staged decoders, the planning overhead peaks at just $0.57\text  { ms}$—operating safely within a sub-millisecond envelope and rendering it virtually cost-free for real-time compilation.}}{11}{figure.caption.6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:verifier_latency}{{5}{11}{Physical verification latency as a function of CFG complexity. The interval-based abstract interpretation maintains strict linear scaling $\mathcal {O}(|V| + |E|)$. Empirical measurements confirm that even for dense, multi-staged decoders, the planning overhead peaks at just $0.57\text { ms}$—operating safely within a sub-millisecond envelope and rendering it virtually cost-free for real-time compilation}{figure.caption.6}{}}
