\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces Amortized latency per tuple as a function of batch size, measured with micro-architectural hardware probes. The curves highlight a severe transition penalty for Wasm at micro-batches, which logarithmically decays into a highly efficient, L1/L2-driven execution plateau.}}{11}{figure.caption.7}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:batch_overhead}{{6}{11}{Amortized latency per tuple as a function of batch size, measured with micro-architectural hardware probes. The curves highlight a severe transition penalty for Wasm at micro-batches, which logarithmically decays into a highly efficient, L1/L2-driven execution plateau}{figure.caption.7}{}}
